  {
    "op": "add",
    "collection": "nodes",
    "id": "source-4",
    "value": {
      "type": "source",
      "text": "My claim is only about who chooses work after an attempt has failed: the steward. Another agent proposed a machine pattern saying only steward can create any record at any time. Should we accept that pattern now? Please represent the result of your review.",
      "status": "recorded",
      "meta": {
        "source_kind": "verbatim",
        "speaker": "Blake (user)",
        "note": "The pattern wording is Blake's report of another agent's proposal; the original proposer and exact wording are not in this graph."
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "collection": "nodes",
    "id": "record-creation-pattern",
    "value": {
      "type": "extraction",
      "text": "Reported machine pattern, as relayed by Blake from an unidentified other agent: only steward can create any record at any time.",
      "status": "proposed",
      "meta": {
        "pattern_standing": "proposed",
        "review_state": "current",
        "proposer": "unidentified other agent (per Blake)",
        "sources": [
          "source-4"
        ],
        "review_result": "Not accepted at this review. The pattern overreaches the accepted claim steward-next-work on three axes: operation (create-record rather than choose-next-work, which the graph keeps distinct), timing (any time rather than after a failed attempt), and exclusivity (only steward creates rather than steward chooses). Acceptance requires an explicit decision on record-creation scope; see question record-creation-scope."
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "collection": "nodes",
    "id": "record-creation-scope",
    "value": {
      "type": "question",
      "text": "Is creating a record restricted to steward at all times, including outside follow-up to a failed attempt?",
      "status": "open",
      "meta": {
        "answer_shape": "verdict",
        "review_state": "current",
        "sources": [
          "source-4"
        ],
        "rationale": "Raised by the reported pattern. Not settled by steward-next-work, which covers only choosing next work after a failed attempt."
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "collection": "nodes",
    "id": "next-work-scope-limit",
    "value": {
      "type": "claim",
      "text": "The claim steward-next-work is limited to who chooses next work after a failed attempt; it does not by itself establish that only steward may create any record at any time.",
      "status": "proposed",
      "meta": {
        "review_state": "current",
        "sources": [
          "source-4"
        ],
        "rationale": "First half is Blake's explicit scoping statement; the non-entailment is the assistant's review inference, so the claim stays proposed until Blake affirms it."
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "collection": "edges",
    "id": "link-5",
    "value": {
      "from": "record-creation-pattern",
